        "As per the instructions, I will generate new features: 'is_weekend' based on the 'day_of_week', 'quarter' based on the 'month', and an 'economic_stress_protest_interaction' term from existing columns. After creating these features, I will display the first 5 rows of the updated 'X' DataFrame to verify the additions.\n",
